<h2 class="section-title">Featured projects</h2>
<h2 class="section-title">Advanced load control, CFB boiler</h2><div class="section-promo__layout section-promo__layout--card"><figure class="figure--embed"><img src="/assets/img/projects/emissions-monitoring-display.jpg" alt="Emissions monitoring display showing dust, NOx and SO2 readings" width="960" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Emissions monitoring display showing dust, NOx and SO2 readings</figcaption></figure><div class="section-promo__text"><p>Energy boiler, 260 t/h steam at 100 bar, circulating fluidized bed, firing petroleum coke, coal, gas and fuel oil, on DCS Emerson Ovation.</p>
<p><strong>Delivered:</strong> coordinated boiler–turbine load control; solid fuel allocation across feeders by heat value; steam temperature control by cascade regulators with a superheater model; primary and secondary air control; SO2 and NOx regulation through furnace temperature and lime dosing; automatic calculation of petroleum coke calorific value; and an oxygen cascade controller referenced to boiler mode and fuel.</p>
<p><a href="/advanced-controllers-cfb-boiler.html">Read more</a></p></div></div>
<h2 class="section-title">Virtual power plant</h2><div class="section-promo__layout section-promo__layout--card"><figure class="figure--schematic"><a href="/assets/img/2024/08/11/virtual-power-plant.jpg"><img src="/assets/img/2024/08/11/virtual-power-plant.jpg" alt="Virtual power plant dispatch schematic" width="1000" height="503" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><figcaption>Virtual power plant dispatch schematic — <a href="/assets/img/2024/08/11/virtual-power-plant.jpg">Open full size</a></figcaption></figure><div class="section-promo__text"><p>Four photovoltaic plants, one wind farm and one conventional gas/coal plant with boilers and steam turbines combined into a single dispatch unit: three remote PV control systems at 1 MW each, a local PV control system at 9 MW and a remote wind control system at 80 MW, all connected to the gas/coal plant control system, with output balanced by the steam turbine to a predetermined schedule.</p>
<p><a href="/virtual-power-plant.html">Read more</a></p></div></div>
<h2 class="section-title">Plant performance monitoring</h2><div class="section-promo__layout section-promo__layout--card"><figure class="figure--embed"><img src="/assets/img/2024/08/11/combustion-efficiency.jpg" alt="Combustion efficiency monitoring display" width="1000" height="503" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Combustion efficiency monitoring display</figcaption></figure><div class="section-promo__text"><p>Real-time efficiency of boilers, turbines and heat exchangers against design values, with the cost of losses and deviations from factory specification calculated continuously, plus energy and material balances for water, steam, gas and electricity. Data from DCS ABB Industrial IT and DCS Emerson Ovation over OPC, and from SCADA and commercial metering over Modbus, with central long-term archiving. Calculations follow ASME and other industry standards.</p>
<p><a href="/power-plant-performance-calculation.html">Read more</a></p></div></div>
<h2 class="section-title">Control centers</h2><div class="section-promo__layout section-promo__layout--card"><figure class="figure--embed"><img src="/assets/img/projects/control-room-combined-cycle.jpg" alt="Combined-cycle plant control room" width="960" height="640" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Combined-cycle plant control room</figcaption></figure><div class="section-promo__text"><p>Design, manufacture and supply of control room equipment and operator furniture, covering acoustics, layout, lighting, microclimate, backup power and operator interface, specified for 24/7 operation.</p>
<p><a href="/service/industrial-furniture-control-centers.html">Read more</a></p></div></div>
